Protein name: Hemoglobin subunit beta
Organism: Homo sapiens
UniProt Accession ID: P68871
Protein function: Involved in oxygen transport from the lung to the various peripheral tissues.1
Cellular location: blood microparticle, cytosol, endocytic vesicle lumen, extracellular exosome, extracellular region, extracellular space, ficolin-1-rich granule lumen, haptoglobin-hemoglobin complex, hemoglobin complex,tertiary granule lumen

